  "courseSlug": "vuejs-2-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Vue - The Complete Guide (incl. Router & Composition API)",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21880218",
      "title": "Working with Provide/ Inject",
      "lectureOrder": 299,
      "videoOrder": 266,
      "sourceHash": "c6343cacc19941736f1bb5d4b879dc643e4349252e65ee805f7f96691f55786c",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.22,
          "end": 4.3,
          "en": "Now I got two more features I wanna cover",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.3,
          "end": 5.95,
          "en": "with the Composition API.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.95,
          "end": 8.71,
          "en": "The first one is provide inject.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.71,
          "end": 11.19,
          "en": "We're not using it here, but let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.19,
          "end": 15.29,
          "en": "instead of forwarding the age to user data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.29,
          "end": 18.79,
          "en": "through the age prop, which of course would be fine here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.79,
          "end": 20.93,
          "en": "and actually would be the recommended way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.93,
          "end": 22.01,
          "en": "but instead of doing that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.01,
          "end": 25.17,
          "en": "let's say we wanna provide inject it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.17,
          "end": 28.55,
          "en": "So I remove the age prop from user data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.55,
          "end": 31.483,
          "en": "I also remove it there from the props array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.54,
          "end": 35.57,
          "en": "and now instead, I wanna provide and inject it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.57,
          "end": 40.57,
          "en": "With the Options API, we simply added this provide option,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.26,
          "end": 43.26,
          "en": "which could be a function in which",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.26,
          "end": 46.15,
          "en": "we return our provided object, if you remember.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.15,
          "end": 49.523,
          "en": "And there, we could have provided our age like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.1,
          "end": 56.56,
          "en": "Well, with the Composition API, we have an equivalent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.56,
          "end": 60.883,
          "en": "We can import provide from Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.33,
          "end": 65.93,
          "en": "So that's another feature exposed by the Vue framework",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.93,
          "end": 67.74,
          "en": "which we can import.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 67.74,
          "end": 71.34,
          "en": "And provide also, like all these things here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.34,
          "end": 73.493,
          "en": "which we import, is a function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.97,
          "end": 77.43,
          "en": "And we can for example, call it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 77.43,
          "end": 80.57,
          "en": "after I initialize my uAge ref,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 80.57,
          "end": 85.57,
          "en": "and provide a value by passing two arguments to provide.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 86.88,
          "end": 89.57,
          "en": "The first one is a key of your choice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 89.57,
          "end": 91.66,
          "en": "UserAge, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 91.66,
          "end": 94.87,
          "en": "The second parameter then is the actual value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 94.87,
          "end": 96.06,
          "en": "you wanna provide.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 96.06,
          "end": 98.913,
          "en": "So here, uAge, this uAge ref.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 100.03999999999999,
          "end": 102.06,
          "en": "And since I'm providing a ref here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 102.06,
          "end": 104.7,
          "en": "the places where I will inject it later",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 104.7,
          "end": 106.99000000000001,
          "en": "will automatically be updated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 106.99000000000001,
          "end": 109.50999999999999,
          "en": "and be notified about changes to age,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.50999999999999,
          "end": 111.223,
          "en": "so that's a nice thing here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 112.43,
          "end": 115.22,
          "en": "So now we provide userAge like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 115.22,
          "end": 117.57,
          "en": "and now the only other thing we gotta do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117.57,
          "end": 121.11,
          "en": "is we gotta go to the place where we wanna inject it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 121.11,
          "end": 123.1,
          "en": "in this case, user data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 123.1,
          "end": 127.62,
          "en": "and now we don't use the inject option here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 127.62,
          "end": 132.62,
          "en": "Instead, we import the inject function from Vue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 134.93,
          "end": 137.53,
          "en": "and then here, in the set up method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 137.53,
          "end": 142.53,
          "en": "I can call inject and use the same key I used for provide,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 143.89,
          "end": 148.223,
          "en": "so in my case, userAge here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 149.15,
          "end": 152.12,
          "en": "and this will give me this provided value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 152.12,
          "end": 156.45,
          "en": "And I can then just store it in a constant of my choice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 156.45,
          "end": 160.01,
          "en": "And what I get here will be the value I provide here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 160.01,
          "end": 162.12,
          "en": "so in this case, this ref.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 162.12,
          "end": 165.22,
          "en": "So here, age will also be a ref.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 165.22,
          "end": 169.82,
          "en": "Now you should not change the age from down there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 169.82,
          "end": 173.07999999999998,
          "en": "This would work, but it would be very unpredictable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 173.07999999999998,
          "end": 175.34,
          "en": "As a strong recommendation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 175.34,
          "end": 178.81,
          "en": "you should only change injected values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 178.81,
          "end": 181.46,
          "en": "in the place where you provide them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 181.46,
          "end": 184.55,
          "en": "So in this case, in the App.vue file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 184.55,
          "end": 187.96,
          "en": "You can absolutely read the injected value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 187.96,
          "end": 191.83,
          "en": "or in this case, expose it to the template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 191.83,
          "end": 196.14,
          "en": "Expose age under the age key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 196.14,
          "end": 198.16,
          "en": "and therefore we can use this shorthand,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 198.16,
          "end": 201.18,
          "en": "and now age is available in the template again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 201.18,
          "end": 203.54,
          "en": "even though it's not a prop anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 203.54,
          "end": 206.627,
          "en": "But if we save it, you see the age here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 206.627,
          "end": 209.883,
          "en": "and if I click Change Age, it also updates correctly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 210.77,
          "end": 214.35,
          "en": "So that's provide inject with the Composition API.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 214.35,
          "end": 218.65,
          "en": "I would argue that it's even a bit easier and less code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 218.65,
          "end": 220.403,
          "en": "than with the Options API.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
